  source_lineage AddressPlane / institutional packet-switching vision
  known_gap SID ANN via bonfyre-vec awaits the sqlite-vec extension; the learned-optimizer layer is built (see route-ranker)
  known_gap native `SurfaceIR:*`, `InverseCompiler:*`, `MCP:*`, `ProtocolCompiler:late_carrier`, and `MaterialCompiler:*` consumers now accept only their own envelopes. MCP rechecks an authenticated closure snapshot and retains a content-addressed derived descriptor, ProtocolCompiler rechecks the declared chain without enactment, and MaterialCompiler rechecks published CMS source, source-collection, and pack-demand declarations plus current ExternalEstate occurrence topics. Source and external occurrence consumers produce only a ForeignTwin observation demand; generic collection and pack-demand consumers retain rechecked derived declarations; programme collections with template references now delegate source-membership refresh to the existing programme resolver before acknowledging their lowerer handoff. The remaining material boundary is carrier execution and source selection under their own rights and adapter policy; the additive MCP 2026 ingress preserves the staged gateway while stateless clients migrate, but gates even its hand-authored upstream tools behind explicit native aperture advertisements until their owner contracts lower further. AddressPlane intentionally owns forwarding/delivery and never executes any lowerer itself
  known_gap AddressPlane exports its shared index family now; each exact owner still owes measured per-body passports and runtime CopyReceipts before representation cost can participate in ResourceAdmission

